{
  "id": "MAT.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 19",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwarugu iita nung'wiischooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoahiit Yesu ng'asheesu ghabeawa ng'eanyiida Galilaya ak gawa ng'eanyiida Yahudi, giigheawda eenda Yordani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwaat geeshta eemeeda saang'a ak ghoahaap aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghapka headaanyi Farisaayajeega ak gwasimsim nea gwayeesha, “Heapi ghwadoabiiwi gideaba siida gayghwanung' gatmoadaanyi aba gilinyoo ea ramwasaani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Miyoasoamwana gideaba siida ghayi sineegwa aba mwadi gwasin siida was ng'eedeeda ea siida was gatmooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi, ‘Aba sareani gayghwanung'wa ng'eedeeda heeda ghwaan ea ghaamwat, ak gaygwaroochi sea gatmoadaanyi, ama ng'ata ghoah fiisu asiyeenyean saseanagi’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu abeeda ea mudea iyeenya, niiw saseanagi. Asi fugiga aguuyi ASEETEAN, adiidu gooheeli siida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Saawa, “Abeeda iidu goodaydeaysa naaha Musa gheata barawajeanda nung'ooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Musa ghayi ghoadayda gheata jea eanung'wa gatmooda aba hang'ooynacheeka gurooruunatkeagwa, nea abeeda ghayi mwadi ea masunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geayeeshiineegwa: siida wassean jea ghwanung' gatmoadaanyi iimwanung'wa aba ng'asheega hiseadayeanduumeeda, ak ghaghi nuut, gamealuuli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha giinealangaaschi, “Ng'asheega siida ea gatmoadaanyi iisunu, ghang'wana ea meegeeshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Moamu buuneesean ghoang'waay ng'asheanji, geaghus fugiga adaw ASEETEAN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwanda gulanga siji nea gwasunu ghang'eada jeesinga gheamadiga nyaawa, ak gwanda gulanga nung' buuneeda ghoah gulanga, ak gwanda gulanga sin geat gulanga aba sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda. Dea ammu ghoang'waay ng'asheanji, ea daang'waanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gang'usha diibiga manang'i",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu geeyeassa diibiga manang'i ghwayiin geatingaaschi iheenga diibiga ak ghamwaash ghawooda aba badahuuka nyaawa. Iidu goojuursa giinealanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwayeesha Yesu, “Anung'waada diibiga manang'i ghapka heedeanyu, adoakghuumnyi; aba gideaba fuga uurji suh sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda daanyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin geatingaaschi iheenga nyaawa, ak ghabeawa ng'eanyiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheareemaneeda was meanang'oocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabeesa Siyagi ak gwayeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, gaydasin ana ng'ashaan miy iijeadanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha niny, “Ghwasaan anda giinyaashchaan iita miyinda? Siida miy ea agi, ama iigasayi una jeeda eaweega, giing'waanyi digheanyeeka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Akeega?” Gwayeesha Yesu, “Adinuusi siida, adimealuuli, adijagwadiischi, adinapiisi siida ng'uyyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sissiina mureeda gweanu ea geamadu, ak gibwariiydi giischeewoocheandaang'u gidubwariiydi geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha gheareemaneedida, “Ng'asheesu seaniin nigeawiit daang'waay; abeeda gudu ghwashoadeawaan naaha gicha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Iigasayi huwa siida hidaat, guwi ak gishaaydi haleanjeadaang'u indeawi, ak giidawi fuga barbari, ak abeeda gaymideawana gheaseeda aba humng'eeda, ama ng'ata guwuni eani geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Gheareemaneedida ng'asheanji ghang'eat gawa nea gagiisan, aba gideaba gwandeawa haleanjeeda saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu giinealangaaschi, “Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa gajeahang'waay beata jea gawa meanang'oocheanda jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuut gicha geayeeshiineegwa, gajea wusis muuchi gideaba gaygwasik diyeayda siguura ngamiya seawadeeda sidageeda ea ea mawuurji gideaba gaygawa meanang'oocheanda jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy giinealanga ghahamng'eanyi muuchi nea gwayi, “Abeeda iisunu gayghoamu ghwalaalaan ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goong'weersa Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Ng'asheanji aba buuneeda ahang'waay, ak aba heeda ASEETA ea wusis.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghwasha Betaro nea gwayeesha, “Ang'wearda, aseasa sinung'wi heeda haleanjeeda sean ak geeyeadu geashtaang'u. Abeeda gajeanyasa naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, agoogeeda ooyeadu geeshteanyu aba ng'eanyiideesh, jea ghwahidu eaweeda jea goopteadawa Orjeeda Siida hoorgeadaanyi ghaambiidaat, abeeda eara agooga gajoopiidana hoorgajeegiga atamaniyeenyean ak goorgweaksi eemoojigiga atamaniyeenya bea Israeliin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giliwas sih nung'usa heeda gheeda ghana orjeeda ghaamwat ghana haweega ghaamwat ghana ghwaan ghana ghaamwat ghana diibiga ghana madameega, aba badayda gheawungeasu, gayghwanyas niba bughala ak gwahearan eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
